  "title": "Flood Fill Region",
  "summary": "Recolor the four-directionally connected region containing a starting cell and return the image.",
  "statement": "Starting at the given row and column, recolor that cell and every cell connected to it through up, down, left, or right moves that has the starting cell's original color. Diagonal contact does not connect regions.",
